sequenceDiagram
  %% Target design: ADR 0244 task + full intent as inputs, single-swamp-node (@swamp/ssh from 209).
  %% status: draft
  autonumber
  %% lane CLI icon=terminal pill=caller tone=gray
  %% lane GW icon=gateway pill=intent tone=blue
  %% lane SW icon=workflow pill=executes tone=green
  %% lane N icon=server pill=target tone=amber
  participant CLI as CLI / MCP<br/>on app-dev Node
  participant GW as Gateway<br/>Laravel API
  participant SW as Swamp<br/>serve on Node 209
  participant N as app-dev Node<br/>reached over ssh
  CLI->>GW: instance:register<br/>{project: 7, path, name}
  Note over GW: Check caller and path<br/>Instance 42 reserved · #5131
  GW->>SW: Start run, full intent<br/>operation-instance-register
  GW-->>CLI: 202 Accepted<br/>operation #5131
  SW->>N: Inspect the checkout<br/>@swamp/ssh · owner, mode, git dir
  SW->>N: Read origin, branch, HEAD<br/>git -C checkout, hooks off
  alt source matches the Project
    N-->>SW: branch, commit, digest
    SW->>N: Protect the .env file<br/>@swamp/ssh · protect_environment
    SW-->>GW: Run succeeded<br/>terminal event · source.result
    Note over GW: Store source facts<br/>Instance 42 → active
  else origin or owner differs
    N--xSW: check fails, error_code
    SW--xGW: Run failed<br/>failed_step, error_code
    Note over GW: Keep Instance 42 reserved<br/>task → failed
  end
  loop every 2 s until terminal
    CLI->>GW: operation:show #5131
    GW-->>CLI: status + result
  end
